<header class="ref-head cen-head"><p class="cty-kicker">History by century · The 1200s</p><h1 class="research-title">The 13th century</h1><p class="ref-lede">In the 1200s, 981 recorded states existed somewhere in the world. 357 were founded and 204 came to an end. The great powers of the age included the Mongol Empire, the Kingdom of France and the Southern Song.</p></header>
